Subject: [PATCH] ctrl: native backhaul takes an agent's station from its Device Information

The native backhaul module knows an agent's backhaul station only from the device's
backhaul_sta, which em_ctrl sets from a Backhaul STA Radio Capabilities TLV: in a
Topology Response (RDK's agents put one there) or in the Backhaul STA Capability Report
to its query, which em_ctrl sends only after such a Topology Response. An agent that
reports its station the R1 way, as a non-AP STA interface with its parent BSSID in its
Device Information TLV (EMOSA's pods), was never queried, so its node had no station:
no serving sample was ever requested for it, a move of it (requested through
em_ctrl, as the rooms do) was never verified, and the uncertain mark each such move left
never cleared (rdk-1004, 5 October 2026: both pods marked for the rest of a two-hour
run). The station learned from that interface (the backhaul STA row the controller
keeps for it, on the agent's current parent) now stands in when backhaul_sta is unset.

Upstream-Status: Pending

--- a/src/ctrl/em_backhaul_ctrl.cpp	2026-10-05 14:34:37.388048798 -0700
+++ b/src/ctrl/em_backhaul_ctrl.cpp	2026-10-05 14:34:44.404068486 -0700
@@ -84,6 +84,26 @@
             station.sta = backhaul_mac(model->get_device_info()->backhaul_sta);
             station.parent_bssid = backhaul_mac(model->get_device_info()->backhaul_mac.mac);
             if (!backhaul_unicast(station.sta)) station.sta.clear();
+            if (station.sta.empty() && backhaul_unicast(station.parent_bssid)) {
+                /* An agent that reports its backhaul station only in its Device Information,
+                 * as a non-AP STA interface with its parent BSSID (EMOSA's pods), never gets a
+                 * Backhaul STA Capability Query: em_ctrl sends one only for a Backhaul STA
+                 * Radio Capabilities TLV in a Topology Response. The station learned from that
+                 * interface, on the agent's current parent. Without it the agent had no serving
+                 * sample, its moves were never verified and its uncertain mark never cleared
+                 * (rdk-1004, 5 Oct 2026). */
+                for (unsigned int index = 0; index < model->m_num_bss; ++index) {
+                    const em_bss_info_t *bss = model->get_bss_info(index);
+                    if (!bss->enabled || bss->vap_mode != em_vap_mode_sta ||
+                        bss->id.haul_type != em_haul_type_backhaul ||
+                        backhaul_mac(bss->bssid.mac) != station.parent_bssid) continue;
+                    const std::string learned = backhaul_mac(bss->sta_mac);
+                    if (backhaul_unicast(learned)) {
+                        station.sta = learned;
+                        break;
+                    }
+                }
+            }
             network.nodes[owner] = station;
             for (unsigned int index = 0; index < model->m_num_bss; ++index) {
                 const em_bss_info_t *bss = model->get_bss_info(index);
